    {
      "id": "9ba70454-69b5-46f8-8061-cd675740c971",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        5152,
        2672
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 848,
        "content": "## Track core skills for a role from live job postings\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow tracks core skills for a target role by searching live job postings, deduplicating the results, and sending the posting content to an AI model for skill analysis. It can be run manually from a form or automatically on a daily schedule, then records skill trends, run summaries, and the latest configuration back to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and configure the spreadsheet/ranges used for the last config, skill trend log, run summary, and config update nodes.\n- Add a SerpApi API key to the job search HTTP request and verify the search query parameters match the role and location inputs.\n- Add an OpenRouter API key to the AI analysis HTTP request and choose the desired chat completion model.\n- Configure the manual form fields and daily schedule timing so they provide or reuse the expected role/search inputs.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the SerpApi search parameters, deduplication/limit logic, AI prompt, or Google Sheets columns to track different roles, locations, skill categories, or reporting formats."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
